@using Resources
<div class="card mb-1">
    <h6 class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-primary">
        <span><i class="mdi mdi-information-outline me-2"></i> @AdvancedShield.TSC_Advanced_Security_Shield_Configuration_Tips</span>
        <button class="btn btn-light btn-sm" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTips" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTips">
            <i class="mdi mdi-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
    </h6>
    <div id="collapseTips" class="collapse">
        <div class="card-body">
            <ul class="mb-0">

                <li>
                    <strong>RequestLimit</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Defines_how_many_requests_a_single_user_or_session_is_allowed_to_make_during_a_short_period.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.This_prevents_users_from_overloading_the_server.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> @AdvancedShield.Set_to <code>100</code> @AdvancedShield.to_allow_up_to_100_requests_per_minute_per_user.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>TimeWindowSeconds</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.The_time_window_in_seconds_in_which_the_system_counts_the_number_of_requests_per_user.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Combined_with <code>@AdvancedShield.Request_Limit</code> @AdvancedShield.to_detect_rapid_access.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> @AdvancedShield.With_a_60_second_window_users_who_send_over_100_requests_in_1_minute_are_blocked.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>BlockDurationMinutes</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.The_time_in_minutes_that_a_user_or_IP_will_be_denied_access_after_hitting_a_limit.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Prevents_abuse_and_gives_time_for_cooling_down.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> @AdvancedShield.Set_to <code>15</code> to block attackers for 15 minutes.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>IPRequestLimit</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Number_of_requests_allowed_from_the_same_IP_address_within_the_IP_specific_window.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Protects_against_external_bots_and_DDoS_from_a_single_source.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> @AdvancedShield.Set_to <code>300</code> @AdvancedShield.to_tolerate_up_to_300_requests_from_the_same_IP_in_a_short_time.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>IPTimeWindowSeconds</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Time_frame_used_to_track_IP_based_request_limits.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Smaller_windows_catch_fast_flooding_traffic.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> If set to <code>30</code>, then 300+ requests from one IP in 30s will trigger a block.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>WhitelistedHeaders</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.HTTP_headers_that_when_present_tell_the_system_to_skip_rate_limiting.
                <span class="text-muted">Used_for_internal_services_monitoring_agents_or_exempt_systems.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> Add <code>X-Internal-Request</code> for requests made by trusted servers.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>WhiteListedCountriesCode</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.List_of_allowed_countries_using_2_letter_ISO_codes.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Enforces_GeoIP_based_access_control.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>CM</code> allows Cameroon; <code>FR</code> allows France.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>CameroonCidrs</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.CIDR_formatted_IP_ranges_representing_valid_Cameroon_network_blocks.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Filters_traffic_to_allow_only_Cameroon_based_addresses.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>102.244.128.0/18</code> (range), <code>105.112.5.45/32</code> (single IP).
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>SuspiciousIndicators</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Words_or_filenames_that_often_appear_in_malicious_requests.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Used_to_detect_hacking_attempts_or_scanning_tools.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>shell.php</code>, <code>.env</code>, <code>wp-login</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>BadUserAgents</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Identifiers_from_the_User_Agent_header_used_by_known_bots_or_exploit_tools.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Requests_with_these_agents_are_blocked_immediately.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>curl</code>, <code>sqlmap</code>, <code>python-requests</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>AllowedOrigins</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Valid_websites_or_domains_allowed_to_send_cross_origin_requests.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Protects_against_CSRF_and_CORS_based_spoofing.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>https://secure.tsccore.cm</code>, <code>https://camccul.org</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>TelemetryHeaderPrefixes</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Header_name_prefixes_used_by_bot_trackers_debuggers_or_monitoring_tools.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Used_to_block_automated_or_non_human_traffic.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>x-openai-</code>, <code>x-datadog-</code>, <code>cf-ray</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>HighRiskHeaderKeys</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Custom_headers_often_seen_in_penetration_testing_or_exploit_payloads.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Blocked_to_prevent_injection_attacks.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>x-sql-injection</code>, <code>x-command-injection</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>ProtectedPathRefererRequired</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Routes that must include a valid <code>Referer</code> header.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Prevents_direct_access_or_deep_linking_into_sensitive_pages.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>/admin</code>, <code>/user/settings</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>SensitiveHeaderMissingCheckPaths</strong>:
                    Paths where both <code>Origin</code> and <code>Referer</code> headers are mandatory.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Used_to_secure_login_and_token_endpoints_against_CSRF.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>/api/login</code>, <code>/token</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>SpoofedForwardedForIndicators</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.IP_values_that_are_considered_fake_or_internal.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Helps detect spoofed <code>X-Forwarded-For</code> headers.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>127.0.0.1</code>, <code>::1</code>, <code>localhost</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>ExcludedPaths</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.URLs_that_bypass_all_security_filtering.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Use_for_static_resources_like_images_or_JS.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>/favicon.ico</code>, <code>/signalr/hubs</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>ExcludedSubstrings</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Any_request_path_that_contains_these_words_will_skip_filtering.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Useful_for_allowing_non_sensitive_internal_tools.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>dashboard</code>, <code>keepalive</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>ExcludedExtensions</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.File_extensions_that_are_skipped_from_inspection.
                    <span class="text-muted">@AdvancedShield.Improves_performance_for_static_asset_delivery.</span><br />
                    <em>Example:</em> <code>.css</code>, <code>.js</code>, <code>.png</code>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>Reset Policy</strong>:
                    @AdvancedShield.Deleting_the_current_configuration_will_restore_the_default_secure_policy.
                    <span class="text-muted">⚠️ @AdvancedShield.This_cannot_be_undone_All_custom_rules_will_be_erased.</span>
                </li>

            </ul>

        </div>

        <!-- Default Config Display -->
        <div class="alert alert-secondary mt-3">
            <strong>@AdvancedShield.Sample_Configuration_Snapshot:</strong><br />
            <code>
                RequestLimit = 100<br />
                TimeWindowSeconds = 60<br />
                BlockDurationMinutes = 15<br />
                IPRequestLimit = 300<br />
                IPTimeWindowSeconds = 30<br />
                WhitelistedHeaders = ["FLUXTSC-Internal-Request"]<br />
                WhiteListedCountriesCode = ["CM", "FR"]<br />
                CameroonCidrs = ["102.244.128.0/18", "105.112.5.45/32"]<br />
                SuspiciousIndicators = [".env", "wp-login", "shell.php", "sqlmap"]<br />
                BadUserAgents = ["curl", "sqlmap", "python-requests", "nmap"]<br />
                AllowedOrigins = ["https://secure.tsc.cm", "https://fluxcm.org"]<br />
                TelemetryHeaderPrefixes = ["x-openai-", "x-datadog-", "cf-ray"]<br />
                HighRiskHeaderKeys = ["x-sql-injection", "x-command-injection"]<br />
                ProtectedPathRefererRequired = ["/admin", "/settings"]<br />
                SensitiveHeaderMissingCheckPaths = ["/api/login", "/token"]<br />
                SpoofedForwardedForIndicators = ["127.0.0.1", "::1", "localhost"]<br />
                ExcludedPaths = ["/favicon.ico", "/signalr/hubs", "/content/"]<br />
                ExcludedSubstrings = ["dashboard", "keepalive"]<br />
                ExcludedExtensions = [".css", ".js", ".png", ".woff2"]
            </code>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
